# A whitelist: this working tree also holds the HackiOS checkouts (hackios-xnu-kernel/, tens of GB with iOS,
# Mu-Silicium and build output), research/ (the phone's partitions, vendor sources, dumps), reference clones
# and build output, none of which belongs in this repository. Nothing is tracked unless it is named here.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/README.md
!/NOTES.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/setup.sh
!/legacy/

# build output of the ios-sweet shim and kernel series (legacy)
/legacy/sweet/shim/out/
/legacy/sweet/xnu/out/
/legacy/sweet/xnu/out-*/

# device dumps (persist/modemst/fsg hold IMEI and calibration; a live DT holds the serial), the phone's firmware
backup/
dtb/
dtb-*/
recovery/
fw-*/
*.img
*.dtb
logs/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*~
*.orig
*.rej
.DS_Store
